.Dd August 30, 2026
.Dt OPENPROJECT.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm openproject.conf
.Nd OpenProject environment configuration
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/openproject.env
.Sh DESCRIPTION
OpenProject cannot consume JSON.
It reads environment variables.
The file
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/openproject.env
is sourced by
.Xr openproject 8
before Puma
.Pq rc.d/openproject
and the
.Li good_job
worker
.Pq rc.d/openproject_worker
start.
.Pp
A sample is installed as
.Pa openproject.env.sample .
Copy it, replace
.Li REPLACE_ME
placeholders, and set mode 0600.
.Pp
An optional JSON file
.Pa config.json
in the same directory can generate the env file
.Pq Cm openproject env .
That JSON is CloudBSD editor sugar only.
.Sh VARIABLES
.Bl -tag -width OPENPROJECT_CACHE__MEMCACHE__SERVER
.It Ev RAILS_ENV
Default
.Li production .
.It Ev HOST , Ev PORT
Puma bind.
Track uses
.Li 127.0.0.1
and
.Li 3000 .
.It Ev SECRET_KEY_BASE
Must be unique per install and persistent across upgrades.
Generate once with
.Ql openssl rand -hex 64 .
Do not regenerate on every start.
.It Ev DATABASE_URL
PostgreSQL 16 or 17 URL
.Pq postgresql://user:pass@127.0.0.1:5432/openproject .
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_HOST__NAME
Public hostname.
Default
.Li track.cloudbsd.org .
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_HTTPS
Must be
.Li true
when nginx sends
.Li X-Forwarded-Proto: https .
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_DEFAULT__LANGUAGE
Default
.Li en .
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_RAILS__CACHE__STORE
.Li memcache
when memcached is used.
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_CACHE__MEMCACHE__SERVER
Default
.Li 127.0.0.1:11211 .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent -compact
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/openproject.env
Live environment file.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/openproject.env.sample
Installed sample.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/config.json.sample
Optional JSON wrapper sample.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr openproject 8
.Sh AUTHORS
This manual page was written for CloudBSD by
.An Mark LaPointe Aq Mt mark@cloudbsd.org .
